  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Typically instances of the Group Public type require active moderation, and other instance types require less moderation, as an alternative to closing a group public instance, i would like to request that group public instances be able to be changed into a regular \"group\" instance. this would allow for the doors to be closed in a sense, but also allow group members to still come by and come back. Functionally like an afterparty mode. \n\nI'm just asking for \"Group Public\" to \"Group\", there may be similar merit to changing Friends+ to Friends, but I consider this less useful. \n\nFor consistency and security, the whitelist (video, string, image) rules for group public should still apply.",
